flowchart TD
    B0([From main flow: Ask a question]) --> BQ[/"User types a question in the chat.<br/>Reminder under the box: do not type personal details"/]
    BQ --> U1{"Is the message understandable and not empty?"}
    U1 -->|No| U2{"Already asked to rephrase once in a row?"}
    U2 -->|No| RE["Fallback: not understood.<br/>Ask the user to rephrase"]
    RE --> RQ[["Quick replies: What can you do? / Back to hub"]]
    RQ -->|What can you do?| CAN["Repeat what Masari can and cannot do"]
    CAN --> BQ
    RQ -->|Back to hub| BEND
    RQ -->|User types again| BQ
    U2 -->|Yes| WEAK
    U1 -->|Yes| DS{"Does the message show worry, stress, or a possible risk to the user?<br/>(rule-based check)"}
    DS -->|Yes| DSM["Calm, kind message: this sounds hard, and a real person can help better than I can.<br/>Talk to a parent, a school counselor, or a trusted adult.<br/>If you are in danger now, contact [VERIFY: official emergency or child helpline].<br/>Masari does not diagnose or give counseling. No live transfer"]
    DSM --> BEND
    DS -->|No| RC{"Rule check: does it ask Masari to decide for the user, predict ability, admission or success, or call a pathway the best?"}
    RC -->|Yes| FD["Fallback: I give suggestions, not decisions or predictions"]
    FD --> QRB
    RC -->|No| SC{"Is it about the Baccalaureate pathways?"}
    SC -->|No| FO["Fallback: outside my scope.<br/>Say what Masari can help with"]
    FO --> QRB
    SC -->|Yes| RT["Retrieve passages from the verified decree sources (BM25)"]
    RT --> EV{"Relevant evidence found?"}
    EV -->|No| WEAK["Fallback: I am not sure and I will not guess"]
    WEAK --> HO["Human handover: Masari stops handling this request.<br/>Refer to the school counselor or the official Ministry website [VERIFY: exact official link].<br/>No live transfer"]
    HO --> BEND
    EV -->|Yes| LLM["Call the model with the retrieved passages only"]
    LLM --> MOK{"Model responded within [TBD] seconds?"}
    MOK -->|No| ERRC([To main flow: Subflow C Technical error recovery])
    MOK -->|Yes| OC{"Output check: does every cited Source ID exist?"}
    OC -->|No| WEAK
    OC -->|Yes| ANS["Answer in plain language with Source IDs.<br/>Unverified details are flagged"]
    ANS --> QRA[["Quick replies: Simple wording / Ask another question / Report wrong information / Back to hub"]]
    QRA -->|Simple wording| LLM
    QRA -->|Ask another question| BQ
    QRA -->|Report wrong information| RPT["Optional reason. Logged anonymously. Thank the user"]
    RPT --> QRA
    QRA -->|Back to hub| BEND
    QRB[["Quick replies: Ask another question / Back to hub"]]
    QRB -->|Ask another question| BQ
    QRB -->|Back to hub| BEND
    BEND([Return to hub in the main flow])
